{
  "version": 1,
  "total_duration": 21.2,
  "title": "共射放大器 · 最大不失真输出",
  "subtitle": "教材第 17 题 · Vcc = 12 V，Rc = RL = 3 kΩ",
  "footnote": "数据：ngspice 瞬态（自动稳态）+ 倍增幅值扫描；原理图：KiCad 导出。",
  "data": {
    "amp": 0.05,
    "freq": 1000,
    "window_cycles": 3,
    "points_per_cycle": 400,
    "probe": {"q": "Q1", "source": "VIC"},
    "circuit": {"vcc": "VCC", "rc": "R2", "rl": "R3"},
    "sweep": {
      "amplitudes": [0.02, 0.05, 0.1, 0.2],
      "window_cycles": 1,
      "points_per_cycle": 200
    }
  },
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "given",
      "layout": "card",
      "duration": 3.0,
      "title": "题目给了什么？",
      "subtitle": "先看清条件，再把公式里的符号和原理图对上",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "pos": [42, 150],
          "gap": 44,
          "size": 16,
          "items": [
            {"text": "V_{CC} = {{circuit.vcc:.0f}} V，R_{c} = R_{L} = {{circuit.rc_kohm:.0f}} kΩ", "at": 0.2},
            {"text": "Q：U_{CEQ} ≈ {{op.u_ceq:.2f}} V，I_{CQ} ≈ {{op.icq:.2f}} mA", "at": 0.7},
            {"text": "输入 {{data.amp_mv:.0f}} mV / {{data.freq_hz:.0f}} Hz 正弦", "at": 1.2},
            {"text": "求：最大不失真输出 U_{o}", "at": 1.7, "accent": true}
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "pos": [42, 340],
          "size": 14,
          "color": "muted",
          "gap": 22,
          "lines": [
            "直流：R1 / R2 把 Q 点偏置在放大区",
            "交流：C1 / C2 耦合，Rc 与 RL 共同决定负载"
          ],
          "at": 2.0
        },
        {
          "type": "badge",
          "pos": [220, 420],
          "text": "先直流，后交流",
          "kind": "accent",
          "at": 2.3
        },
        {
          "type": "schematic",
          "pos": [500, 112, 440, 330],
          "view": [60, 28, 108, 68],
          "caption": "KiCad 原理图（局部）· 仿真输入按 50 mV / 1 kHz 重设",
          "highlights": [
            {"ref": "R2", "box": [127.5, 44.4, 135.6, 52.2], "at": 0.4, "label": "R_{c}"},
            {"ref": "R3", "box": [156.7, 67.3, 164.6, 75.0], "at": 0.7, "label": "R_{L}"},
            {"ref": "Q1", "box": [124.5, 61.5, 132.5, 72.5], "at": 1.0, "label": "Q1"},
            {"ref": "C2", "box": [143.0, 61.4, 149.1, 65.6], "at": 1.3, "label": "C_{2}"}
          ],
          "paths": [
            {
              "points": [[78.7, 66.0], [91.4, 66.0], [124.5, 66.0], [129.5, 63.5],
                          [143.5, 63.5], [148.6, 63.5], [158.8, 63.5], [158.8, 71.1]],
              "style": "signal",
              "at": 1.6
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "qpoint",
      "layout": "derivation",
      "duration": 3.4,
      "title": "静态工作点：C2 对直流开路",
      "subtitle": "直流负载只有 Rc，Q 点落在直流负载线上",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "pos": [42, 155],
          "size": 17,
          "gap": 40,
          "lines": [
            {"text": "I_{CQ} = (V_{CC} - U_{CEQ}) / R_{c}", "at": 0.2},
            {"text": "= ({{circuit.vcc:.0f}} - {{op.u_ceq:.2f}}) / {{circuit.rc_kohm:.0f}} kΩ", "at": 0.8},
            {"text": "= [[{{op.icq:.2f}} mA]]", "at": 1.4},
            {"text": "U_{CEQ} = V_{CC} - I_{CQ} R_{c}", "at": 2.0},
            {"text": "= [[{{op.u_ceq:.2f}} V]]", "at": 2.5}
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "pos": [42, 390],
          "size": 13.5,
          "color": "muted",
          "gap": 22,
          "lines": [
            "C2 隔直：输出端对直流没有负载，",
            "所以直流负载线只由 Rc 决定。"
          ],
          "at": 2.7
        },
        {
          "type": "plot",
          "pos": [470, 112, 470, 340],
          "xlim": [0, 12.5],
          "ylim": [0, 4.8],
          "xlabel": "u_CE (V)",
          "ylabel": "i_C (mA)",
          "series": [
            {"ref": "load.dc", "style": "line", "color": "dc", "stroke_width": 2.2,
             "reveal": [0.4, 1.5], "at": 0.4},
            {"ref": "qpoint", "style": "dot", "color": "main", "r": 5.5,
             "label": "Q ({{op.u_ceq:.2f}} V, {{op.icq:.2f}} mA)", "at": 1.7}
          ],
          "guides": [
            {"from": "qpoint", "axis": "x", "label": "U_{CEQ}", "at": 2.0},
            {"from": "qpoint", "axis": "y", "label": "I_{CQ}", "at": 2.3}
          ],
          "annotations": [
            {"text": "DC 负载线", "x": 8.6, "y": 1.2, "color": "dc", "at": 1.0},
            {"text": "V_{CC}/R_{c} = {{calc.ic_dc_max_ma:.0f}} mA", "x": 0.35, "y": 4.25, "color": "dc", "at": 1.5},
            {"text": "U_{CEQ} → {{circuit.vcc:.0f}} V 截止点", "x": 7.2, "y": 4.3, "color": "muted", "at": 2.2}
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "acload",
      "layout": "derivation",
      "duration": 4.0,
      "title": "交流负载线：Rc 与 RL 并联",
      "subtitle": "Vcc 交流接地、C2 短路，负载从 {{circuit.rc_kohm:.0f}} kΩ 变成 {{calc.rac_kohm:.1f}} kΩ",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "pos": [42, 150],
          "size": 17,
          "gap": 38,
          "lines": [
            {"text": "V_{CC} 交流接地，C_{2} 短路", "at": 0.2},
            {"text": "R_{ac} = R_{c} ∥ R_{L}", "at": 0.7},
            {"text": "= {{circuit.rc_kohm:.0f}}k ∥ {{circuit.rl_kohm:.0f}}k = [[{{calc.rac_kohm:.1f}} kΩ]]", "at": 1.2},
            {"text": "Δi_{C} = -Δu_{CE} / R_{ac}", "at": 1.8},
            {"text": "斜率 = -1/{{calc.rac_kohm:.1f}} kΩ = [[{{calc.slope_ma_v:.3f}} mA/V]]", "at": 2.3},
            {"text": "过 Q 点：{{calc.u_ce_cutoff_v:.2f}} V ↔ {{calc.ic_ac_max_ma:.2f}} mA", "at": 2.9, "accent": true}
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "pos": [42, 410],
          "size": 13,
          "color": "muted",
          "gap": 21,
          "lines": [
            "Rac 更小 → 负载线更陡 → 同样的 u_CE 摆幅",
            "只需要更小的 i_C 摆幅，输出更容易先碰墙。"
          ],
          "at": 3.2
        },
        {
          "type": "plot",
          "pos": [470, 112, 470, 340],
          "xlim": [0, 12.5],
          "ylim": [0, 6.5],
          "xlabel": "u_CE (V)",
          "ylabel": "i_C (mA)",
          "series": [
            {"ref": "load.dc", "style": "dash", "color": "muted", "stroke_width": 1.4,
             "reveal": [0, 0.5], "at": 0},
            {"ref": "load.ac", "style": "line", "color": "locus", "stroke_width": 2.4,
             "reveal": [0.9, 2.1], "at": 0.9},
            {"ref": "qpoint", "style": "dot", "color": "main", "r": 5.5, "at": 1.8}
          ],
          "triangles": [
            {"origin": "qpoint", "dx": 1.0, "dy": "{{calc.slope_ma_v}}", "at": 2.4,
             "labels": {"dx": "Δu = 1 V", "dy": "Δi = {{calc.slope_abs_ma_v:.3f}} mA"}}
          ],
          "annotations": [
            {"text": "DC", "x": 9.8, "y": 0.65, "color": "muted", "at": 0.5},
            {"text": "AC 负载线", "x": 2.2, "y": 5.75, "color": "locus", "at": 2.0},
            {"text": "斜率 {{calc.slope_ma_v:.3f}} mA/V", "x": 6.6, "y": 4.5, "color": "locus", "at": 2.6}
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "walls",
